  "browserScenarioExecuted": false,
  "conclusion": "All three P2P mutations in p2p.unknown require Idempotency-Key. createP2POrder declares 409 “Duplicate or conflicting order request”; this does not distinguish a duplicate replay from a business conflict or define a stable replay response. mark-paid/release 409 responses describe state conflicts. getP2POrder can read by orderId only; the contract has no lookup by idempotency key or client correlation ID. If an order-create response is lost, the contract does not establish how to find the created order or whether a same-key replay returns the original receipt. Keep p2p.unknown not_verified and do not retry or simulate side-effecting writes.",
